I'm not aware of any good way to get rid of that intrinsic.

>3) can a magic marker be used to 'write' in a blank spellbook for the higher
> level spells.. IE. genocide, polymorph, etc.?

If you know the spell (ie, you've read a spellbook of the same type 
previously) already, and have a bunch of charges on your marker, yes.

>4) Is there anyway of rustproofing a 'named' sword if you didn't get it from
> a fountain or pick an already rustproofed one up?

Read a scroll of enchant weapon while you're confused.

>5) I have tried many times to dip a longsword in the fountain to try and get
>excaliber. spoilers indicate that there is a chance IF excaliber isn't already
>in the game.. Q) How do you know if it Is or isn't in the game?

If you haven't run across it yet, the chances are fairly good that it isn't
in the game yet.  Watch out, though.  Excaliber is a Lawful artifact.  
Non-Lawful characters will get blasted if they handle it.

>6) Is there anyway of bipassing lev 26 when level teleporting.?

Do you mean the Valley of the Dead?  It's a different level from game to
game.  If you do mean the Valley of the Dead, no, there's no way to avoid
stopping at that level when you're teleporting down from higher up.  Note
that if you are below the Valley of the Dead, you can teleport past it 
going up.

